scope: |
  rozum, with a control for each shape in the same file:
  1. a DECLARED `List[String]` return is not remembered as a list, so `rows(0)` emits a CALL. The
     annotation is in the signature -- not an inference limit, a stated fact dropped. I already
     collect `_returnTypes` for the Any boundary; collectLocalSeqs simply never consulted it.
  2. `toInt` on a lambda parameter emits `s as i32` -- `String as i32` is not a cast Rust has.
  Their framing is right: both are a type the walker WAS TOLD, lost at a boundary. For (2) a TOTAL
  helper beats a refusal -- implemented for i64/f64/String it is correct whatever the walker knows,
  which is the same trick that made the Any coercions work.
next: record call-of-a-List-returning-def as a seq; route toInt through a total helper
